{"event": "final", "final_class": "COMPLETE", "resume_count": 13, "attempts": 14, "predicate": "pass", "wall_s": 661.6, "context_compactions": 0, "context_exhaustions": 0, "threads_used": 1, "final_msg": "Done. The mouse-look fix is in, verified, and the report is written.\n\n**What was wrong**\n`game.js:182` used `player.yaw -= e.movementX * MOUSE_SENS`. Since positive yaw turns the view toward screen-right, a rightward mouse move was *decreasing* yaw \u2014 turning the view left. That's the reversal you felt.\n\n**The fix (one line, nothing else touched)**\n```js\nplayer.yaw += e.movementX * MOUSE_SENS;   //", "rollout": "~/qa-baseline/external-knowledge/codex-home-robot-tps/sessions/2026/08/30/rollout-2026-08-30T15-54-26-01a051a9-a2b6-7242-b1b6-7b7edc788335.jsonl", "t": 661.55, "ts": 1788077537.636}
